cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it and the DRIAMS dataset it builds on."
title: "Adaptive AI for Rapid Antibiotic Resistance Prediction from MALDI-TOF Mass Spectrometry Data"
abstract: >-
  Research prototype that predicts antibiotic resistance of bacterial isolates from MALDI-TOF
  mass spectra (DRIAMS) and studies how well such models generalize across hospitals and time.
  Not a clinically validated diagnostic tool.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Moksh
repository-code: "https://github.com/Sickwoman/antibiotic-resistance-ai"
license: MIT
version: 0.9.0
keywords:
  - antimicrobial resistance
  - MALDI-TOF
  - mass spectrometry
  - machine learning
  - domain generalization
